                      type="submit"
                      className="w-full bg-pink-600 hover:bg-pink-500 text-white font-bold py-4 px-6 rounded-xl transition-all shadow-lg shadow-pink-900/20 text-center flex items-center justify-center gap-2"
                    >
                      ✨ Validar Todas (Demo)
